&lt;h2 data-usually-unique-id=&quot;044234883370604133046166&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zqz90zkz74zz76zeez80zz68zz89zz88zvqz86zuxlz73zexxz80zz73z6d6z72zz79zsz77z&quot;&gt;Compensation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Canada Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$125,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$170,000 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Role Description&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Client Platform Engineer on CorpFleet Engineering, you will lead the migration to FleetDM and build the shared platform capabilities that support dependable endpoint operations. You will combine hands-on engineering with technical planning, partnering with Windows, macOS, and Linux engineers to introduce changes safely across a distributed environment.&lt;br&gt;You will develop automation, integrations, and configuration-as-code workflows, validate platform capabilities, and guide phased adoption. Beyond migration, you will improve platform reliability, visibility, and maintainability, helping the team reduce manual work and operate the service with shared ownership.&lt;br&gt;You will partner with Security, IAM, CorpInfra, and support teams to resolve dependencies and make practical trade-offs. This is an individual-contributor position with technical leadership and mentoring responsibilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc70z90zz79z8cz81zjibz77z9gebz89zz75zz71zz73zpg7v7dn&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead the FleetDM migration.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc70z90zz79z8cz81zjibz77z9gebz89zz75zz71zz73zpg7v7dn&quot;&gt; Define scope, requirements, architecture, dependencies, and a phased delivery plan with OS specialists and partner teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc70z90zz79z8cz81zjibz77z9gebz89zz75zz71zz73zpg7v7dn&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineer and operate the shared platform.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc70z90zz79z8cz81zjibz77z9gebz89zz75zz71zz73zpg7v7dn&quot;&gt; Maintain configuration, agent workflows, policies, queries, integrations, and operational automation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc70z90zz79z8cz81zjibz77z9gebz89zz75zz71zz73zpg7v7dn&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make deployment safe and repeatable.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc70z90zz79z8cz81zjibz77z9gebz89zz75zz71zz73zpg7v7dn&quot;&gt; Build version-controlled configuration with automated checks, peer review, controlled rollout, drift detection, and recovery.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc70z90zz79z8cz81zjibz77z9gebz89zz75zz71zz73zpg7v7dn&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Validate capabilities and coexistence.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc70z90zz79z8cz81zjibz77z9gebz89zz75zz71zz73zpg7v7dn&quot;&gt; Identify gaps, clarify management authority, and establish which responsibilities should migrate or remain with existing tools.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc70z90zz79z8cz81zjibz77z9gebz89zz75zz71zz73zpg7v7dn&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make platform health actionable.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc70z90zz79z8cz81zjibz77z9gebz89zz75zz71zz73zpg7v7dn&quot;&gt; Establish trustworthy device populations, data freshness, enrollment and agent health, and owned remediation workflows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc70z90zz79z8cz81zjibz77z9gebz89zz75zz71zz73zpg7v7dn&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Protect service continuity.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc70z90zz79z8cz81zjibz77z9gebz89zz75zz71zz73zpg7v7dn&quot;&gt; Use representative pilots, acceptance gates, employee-impact checks, and clear pause and recovery decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc70z90zz79z8cz81zjibz77z9gebz89zz75zz71zz73zpg7v7dn&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strengthen team capability.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc70z90zz79z8cz81zjibz77z9gebz89zz75zz71zz73zpg7v7dn&quot;&gt; Create reusable patterns, documentation, and shared support coverage through pairing, mentoring, and operational handoffs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc70z90zz79z8cz81zjibz77z9gebz89zz75zz71zz73zpg7v7dn&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Improve efficiency and cost.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc70z90zz79z8cz81zjibz77z9gebz89zz75zz71zz73zpg7v7dn&quot;&gt; Reduce recurring manual work and recommend tooling consolidation where evidence supports it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc70z90zz79z8cz81zjibz77z9gebz89zz75zz71zz73zpg7v7dn&quot;&gt;Significant hands-on experience engineering enterprise endpoint platforms, including deep expertise in at least one of Windows, macOS, or Linux and experience working across OS boundaries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc70z90zz79z8cz81zjibz77z9gebz89zz75zz71zz73zpg7v7dn&quot;&gt;Personal ownership of a multi-phase platform migration or comparable change, including discovery, pilots, rollout, recovery, and operational handover.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc70z90zz79z8cz81zjibz77z9gebz89zz75zz71zz73zpg7v7dn&quot;&gt;Strong practical programming or scripting skills, such as Python, Go, PowerShell, or shell, with production automation and API integration experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc70z90zz79z8cz81zjibz77z9gebz89zz75zz71zz73zpg7v7dn&quot;&gt;Demonstrated use of Git, code review, automated checks, and controlled deployment for configuration or infrastructure changes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc70z90zz79z8cz81zjibz77z9gebz89zz75zz71zz73zpg7v7dn&quot;&gt;Ability to diagnose enrollment, agent, policy, identity, networking, and integration failures and distinguish missing data from healthy devices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc70z90zz79z8cz81zjibz77z9gebz89zz75zz71zz73zpg7v7dn&quot;&gt;Experience establishing monitoring, failure handling, least-privilege access, secrets management, and maintainable operational workflows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc70z90zz79z8cz81zjibz77z9gebz89zz75zz71zz73zpg7v7dn&quot;&gt;Ability to independently define priorities, align cross-functional stakeholders, communicate trade-offs, and mentor engineers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc70z90zz79z8cz81zjibz77z9gebz89zz75zz71zz73zpg7v7dn&quot;&gt;Clear written and verbal communication and effective asynchronous collaboration across regions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc70z90zz79z8cz81zjibz77z9gebz89zz75zz71zz73zpg7v7dn&quot;&gt;Production experience with FleetDM configuration, policies, queries, APIs, agent operations, or deployment automation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc70z90zz79z8cz81zjibz77z9gebz89zz75zz71zz73zpg7v7dn&quot;&gt;Practical osquery and SQL experience, including query validation, performance considerations, targeting, and stale or missing results.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc70z90zz79z8cz81zjibz77z9gebz89zz75zz71zz73zpg7v7dn&quot;&gt;Migration or coexistence experience involving Intune, Jamf, or comparable endpoint-management platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc70z90zz79z8cz81zjibz77z9gebz89zz75zz71zz73zpg7v7dn&quot;&gt;Experience integrating endpoint platforms with identity, security, inventory, or ITSM services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc70z90zz79z8cz81zjibz77z9gebz89zz75zz71zz73zpg7v7dn&quot;&gt;Experience supporting developer-heavy, distributed environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-42z69zz85zx9z84zz79zvz66zz71z4yz65zz67znhz79zc70z90zz79z8cz81zjibz77z9gebz89zz75zz71zz73zpg7v7dn&quot;&gt;Demonstrated improvements in platform operating effort, tool consolidation, or lifecycle cost.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
